<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2015/06/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>protimer</id>
    <version>2.1.0</version>
    <title>ProTimer</title>
    <authors>Srdjan Kotarlic</authors>
    <owners>Srdjan Kotarlic</owners>
    <summary>Free stage timer for live events, presentations, OBS and production crews.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
ProTimer is a free, open-source stage timer for conferences, presentations, churches, theatres, broadcasts and live streams.

## Features

* Countdown, stopwatch and clock modes
* Scrollable rundown with cue timing and automatic advance
* Clean audience output for projectors and confidence monitors
* OBS Browser Source and transparent-background support
* View-only timer, backstage rundown and remote control on phones
* QR codes that can be displayed for audience access
* Bitfocus Companion integration, HTTP API and OSC control
* English and Serbian interface

ProTimer runs locally and does not require an account or subscription.

## Notes

This package installs the current-user Windows x64 build. Windows may show a SmartScreen warning because the upstream installer is not yet code-signed.
]]></description>
